# Generated by scripts/harvester-laptop-setup.ps1 — bakes in absolute,
# machine-specific paths, regenerated fresh on every setup run (one per
# sport since the single-task-runs-everything design was replaced).
# harvester-scrape-*.log is already covered by the blanket *.log rule above.
